# works/mill-day.work
# A yearly event in the yard. An event is a work: it has a date, a time, a place, a price
# and facts of its own. `by:` names the group that puts it on with the bakery.
# In season from `lead` days before the day to the day itself.

id:    mill-day
title: Mill day
kind:  event
on:    05-02
time:  10:00-16:00
lead:  21
place: weserstrasse
by:    drax-mill
facts:
  The mill from Dachau sets up its stones in the yard, bread and cake at the long table.
